<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Bank Panin says first half net up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Bank Panin says first half net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			    (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			52.73	  vs    45.82</p>
<p>    Earnings per share  (rph)    88	    vs     76</p>
<p>    Net interest income	  124.49	  vs   96.86</p>
<p>    Other  operating income     30.99	  vs   38.91</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  74.14	  vs   62.07</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    242.60	  vs  174.56</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Bank Panin, a member of the Panin Group, is a medium-sized privately-owned bank.</p>
